00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:52.540
Uh-oh! What will Shiho-sama get 
while she's that far in the lead?

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.370
<b><b>Special Chance</b></b>

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:55.780
Ta-da!

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:57.460
Special chance?

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:58.210
<b><b>Special Chance</b></b>

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.210
<b><b>Special Chance</b></b>

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.210
<b>The first person to stop on this space can nominate  one member from the group including themselves.</b>

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:01.210
Nominate one of us five?

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:06.470
The person nominated here 
will get a bombshell exposé

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:09.720
that we investigated in
 the Tomodachi Game office!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:15.480
<b>Forgivable</b>

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:15.480
<b>Unforgivable</b>

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:15.360
We'll then collect votes on whether 
that info is forgivable or not.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:19.730
That person can zip ahead based 
on the percentage of the response.

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:19.730
<b>Unforgivable</b>

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:19.560
<b>under 10% - move 0 spaces 
10% range - move 1 space
 20% range - move 2 spaces
 30% range - move 3 spaces
 ... 
90% range - move 9 spaces
 100% range - move 10 spaces</b>

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:23.490
Basically, it's a special chance
 for a huge turnaround!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.490
<b>Special Chance!!</b>

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.010
<i>Chance?</i>

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:28.910
<i>This...</i>

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.990
<i>This puts me in a bind!</i>

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:33.880
<b>Special Chance</b>

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:36.120
<b>The first person to stop on this space can nominate
 one member from the group including themselves.</b>

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:38.840
<i>If I get picked, the fact 
that I stole the two million...</i>

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:42.640
<i>that I applied to play the Tomodachi Game...</i>

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:46.880
<i>There's a good chance 
they'll both be revealed!!</i>

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:51.160
<i>If that gets out, everything 
I've planned will be for nothing!</i>

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.060
Well then, Shiho-sama, who will you pick?

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.980
Will it be Yutori-chan, now 
that she's gotten so cocky?

00:13:56.980 --> 00:14:00.400
Or Shibe, simply because 
he's safe in last place?

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:04.070
Of course if you're up for self-sacrifice, 
you can choose yourself.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:07.780
Ah, but aren't you interested in hearing 
your beloved Yuichi-kun's secrets?

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:12.020
Tenji-kun seems like your ally now, 
so maybe you shouldn't pick him.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:14.040
<i>Yes! That's exactly right!</i>

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.690
On the other hand,

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:19.600
picking the person you trust most 
might be the best move

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:22.540
because there's a good chance 
he isn't guilty of anything.

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.920
<i>W-Why, you...</i>

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:28.780
If he's truly innocent, we 
wouldn't be able find anything

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:30.570
no matter how deep we dig.

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:34.930
If there's nothing to expose, 
then nobody will be hurt, right?

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.810
<i>O-Oh, no! I built up so much 
trust, it's backfiring!</i>

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:41.810
Then, Tenji-san...

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:47.090
Pick me for this, Shiho!

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:48.280
Shibe?!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.610
W-Why you?

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.750
Well, I gave it some thought.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:58.830
I've been thoughtless and have said
 some awful things to you all...

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:02.040
I know this won't make up for all that,

00:15:02.530 --> 00:15:05.530
but I want to stay friends with you guys.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:07.130
Shibe...

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:11.180
<i>I see. Now that he knows she 
didn't have cosmetic surgery,</i>

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.140
<i>he wants to score some points with her.</i>

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.080
And I'm confident.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.390
I'm not hiding anything that can hurt me.

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.020
Not a thing!

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:21.950
Are you sure?

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:24.150
Of course! Don't hold back.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.480
I'll choose Shibe, then.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:28.020
Okay!

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:30.610
<i>That was close!</i>

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:35.020
So, Shibe, you really don't
 have anything to hide?

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:37.080
Like I said, no chance!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:40.620
Too bad! You do!

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.250
I've seen that person somewhere...

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.420
D-Dad?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:52.680
Yup! That's your dad, the public 
prosecutor Shibe Masakazu.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.550
According to our investigation, 
he's had trouble with women,

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:58.500
abused and sexually harassed 
his secretary, and has taken bribes

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.060
from business and criminal organizations.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:06.310
Recently, he's been throwing money 
around to cover up some scandal.

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:09.130
In other words, Shibe's dad is...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.570
<b>total scumbag</b>

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:11.700
a total scumbag.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.970
I didn't think they'd go after his family!

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:21.160
But those aren't <i>his</i> crimes, yeah? 
In his shoes, I wouldn't care.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.910
That's a very childish way of thinking.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:23.720
Huh?

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:28.550
What would you do if your child was 
friends with the son of a criminal?

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.630
W-Well...

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:34.010
"You can't play with kids from that family."

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:35.760
Wouldn't you say something like that?

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:40.270
Y-Yeah, if it was my kid, 
I'd probably think about it.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:42.770
That's how the great majority would react.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:48.120
No matter how pure their friendship is, 
society wouldn't accept it,

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.280
and if the parents are aware of that,

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:54.000
they wouldn't want to put 
their child through hell.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.120
My dad is...

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.490
<i>I can use this!</i>

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.960
Shibe, I'm really sorry.

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:08.710
But that's about your dad.
 I don't hold it against <i>you</i>.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.090
S-Shiho...

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.180
Shiho-chan, keep away from Shibe!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.190
Look Shibe,

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:21.350
is your dad really the only one 
who did something bad?

00:17:21.820 --> 00:17:22.770
Huh?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.430
Well, isn't it strange?

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.440
Why would you volunteer like that?

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.400
W-What do you mean?

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.460
No matter how conscious you are 
of trying to live a squeaky-clean life,

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:36.760
I'm wondering if you still might have done 
something that you just don't remember.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:41.760
It just isn't normal to volunteer like that.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:43.240
Don't you guys think so?

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.720
But you did anyway.

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:49.830
You even insisted that 
you had nothing to hide.

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:51.960
If you're that sure of yourself,

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:57.050
maybe you have done something, 
and you just had your dad cover it up

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.430
with the power of his money!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.940
That's going too far!

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:05.930
Shiho-chan, do you really think 
he had only good intentions?

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:08.890
He wanted to show off for you

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:11.170
once he found out you 
didn't have cosmetic surgery.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.320
I-Is that true, Shibe?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.360
It never made sense to me.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:21.530
How could students like us 
get 20 million yen in debt?

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:25.770
You'll be able to repay your 
20-million-yen debt in a jiffy!

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:27.860
And what else did Manabu say?

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:34.250
That your dad's been throwing around cash 
to try to cover up some big scandal.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:37.870
Maybe that scandal has 
something to do with you.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.910
Shibe-kun...

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:41.510
Yutori! Yuichi!

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:43.430
W-Wait a minute!

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:47.640
Shiho-chan, we should keep our distance 
until this is cleared up.

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:49.600
Shiho!

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:57.820
W-Wait, guys! Listen! Listen to me!

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:00.980
Yuichi! Yutori! Shiho!

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:06.820
Listen... to... me...

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.050
<i>Sorry, Shibe.</i>

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:15.460
<i>That worked even better than
 I expected. I'm a little surprised.</i>

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:20.220
<i>It probably felt good when you 
jumped up like a hero to volunteer.</i>

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:22.470
<i>How awkward.</i>

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:27.890
<i>You really are awkward and stupid, 
you adorable little thing.</i>

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:31.200
W-Why is this happening to me?

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.900
Shibe, you're so lame.

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.650
<b>Forgivable</b>

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:37.650
<b>Unforgivable</b>

