00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:47.240
<i>Shibe is isolated enough, but maybe 
I'll finish him off with the next one</i>

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.660
<i>to make sure he can't get close 
to Shiho-chan again.</i>

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.410
<b>Seventh Period</b>

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:54.920
Let's see. This time there was 
one bad-mouth card.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.380
Huh?

00:19:56.730 --> 00:20:01.130
Shibe, seriously? If this is 
real, that's so cringe.

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:04.430
"Shibe Makoto has actually"

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.600
"killed a person."

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.760
<i>What's the meaning of this?</i>

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.440
<i>I didn't write anything like that!</i>

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:21.360
<i>I mean, I didn't even write
 anything this time!</i>

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:25.110
<i>At first, I wanted to write 
something to finish Shibe off,</i>

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:27.540
<i>but I've already stirred up
 so much trouble.</i>

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:30.810
<i>If I messed up, I thought 
it'd look suspicious,</i>

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.750
<i>so I left my card blank!</i>

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.480
<i>And Shibe killed someone?</i>

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:36.900
<i>Is that true?</i>

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:40.040
<i>No, whether it's true 
or not, that card...</i>

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:42.110
<i>Who was it, and why?!</i>

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:46.530
<i>Wait... That look...</i>

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:50.400
<i>Yuichi, no way! You again?</i>

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:54.890
Senpai, look at this!

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:58.090
Yes, it seems he's starting something again.

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:02.900
Katagiri Yuichi versus the traitor... 
We can't take our eyes off this now.

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:07.650
Katagiri Yuichi must have already 
been setting something up.

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:09.160
Do you remember?

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:13.160
If you were watching closely, 
you must have noticed.

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:17.510
As long as you're not some gullible idiot.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.920
